{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1399732-v5-starting-attributes","id":1399732,"title":"[V5] Starting Attributes","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-06-28T22:07:22-07:00","id":1399732,"title":"[V5] Starting Attributes","content":"Hi All - had a session zero last night for a brand new V5 chronicle. Having now slept on it i think we may have done attributes wrong. When assigning dots eg you assign 4 dots to strength as your best attrbute, does this mean you start with a strength of 5 or 4 ? I guess im asking if characters all start with 1 dot in every attrbute before assinging the dots as per the rules. <br /> <br /> Please let me know which is right.<br /> <br /> Thanks","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6295-dargurd","name":"Dargurd","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"31"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-28T22:35:51-07:00","id":1399737,"title":"","content":"When you finish assigning points, you should have one attribute at 4, three at 3, four at 2, and one at 1.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24808-draconis","name":"Draconis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24808_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"805"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-28T23:03:29-07:00","id":1399738,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Draconis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1399732-v5-starting-attributes?p=1399737#post1399737\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">When you finish assigning points, you should have one attribute at 4, three at 3, four at 2, and one at 1.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Thankyou - i did it right then. I somehow got it in my head every stat should start at 1 and you then added to that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6295-dargurd","name":"Dargurd","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"31"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-29T09:28:51-07:00","id":1399856,"title":"","content":"It can be confusing if you make assumptions based on prior editions. Just take the text literally on its own and you\u2019ll be fine.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/352-black-flag","name":"Black Flag","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar352_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-01T08:36:12-07:00","id":1400319,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6295-dargurd\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"6295\" data-vbnamecard=\"6295\">Dargurd</a> <br /> <br /> How did the session zero go otherwise? Did predator types, backgrounds, and flaws all go smoothly?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11558-nosimplehiway","name":"Nosimplehiway","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11558_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1699"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-05T10:22:48-07:00","id":1401144,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nosimplehiway</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1399732-v5-starting-attributes?p=1400319#post1400319\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6295-dargurd\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"6295\" data-vbnamecard=\"6295\">Dargurd</a><br /> <br /> How did the session zero go otherwise? Did predator types, backgrounds, and flaws all go smoothly?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> It went very well. Session Zero 2nd half is taking place in about 50 mins then with any other luck we can start the first story arc before we finish for the night. We did miss a couple of things during session zero that we will be going back to before we start but nothing major and the only real issues were when we mixed up older editions and tried to find things in V5. <br /> <br /> Overall have to say very positive about the new edition so far. I like the new mechanics related to hunger and the players really like Loresheets.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6295-dargurd","name":"Dargurd","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"31"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}